From 2db9fa31ab9979fe887ad45f139dc1aaf9564392 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:04:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Separate registered hub wake probes from ready
 execution placement

A denied card whose latest park registered its exact probe on this gateway need not execute here: task_wake_checks remains machine-local. Preserve the legacy keep for unknown, mismatched or superseded custody and all independent structural guards. Tests reproduce both ready timer wakes and condition_met history choosing hub before the fix and worker after it; malformed/foreign/superseded custody remains conservative. Focused admission, selfcheck, race and capacity suites pass; scripts/check passes all 20 guards. Alarm capacity fallback is a separate implementation scope.
